[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200100_04_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200100_04_0010","text":"啊……！\nProducer先生，说到啦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200100_04_0020","text":"啊哈～\n那就结束啦～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200100_04_0030","text":"得把黑板擦掉才行"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200100_04_0040","text":"…………\n有、有点可惜呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200100_04_0050","text":"大家都画得很好……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200100_04_0060","text":"是吗～？\n那就拍张照留个念吧～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200100_04_0070","text":"Good"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200100_04_0080","text":"这、这样啊……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200100_04_0090","text":"那、那我也……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200100_04_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200100_04_0100","text":"嗯……！"}]
